aused by laminar flow.\n\nDynamic viscosity (= dynamic viscosity coefficient) 7:\n\nQuantifies the property \u2018viscosity\u2019 by the quotient shear stress t / shear rate y (n=7c/\u00a5)\n\nKinematic viscosity (= kinematic viscosity coefficient) v-\n\nis given by the quotient dynamic viscosity to density (v= 7p).", "metadata": {"doc_id": "8bd4b4f2-f95f-4bd7-8a6b-66b0958648ac", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "information_requirements_r7a_en_part_2.pdf"}}